sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Router as context-router
    participant Primary as Primary Provider (Azure OpenAI)
    participant Secondary as Backup Provider (AWS Bedrock)
    participant Assembler as context-assembler

    Client->>Router: POST /v1/context/route
    Router->>Router: Decision: Target = Azure OpenAI
    Router->>Primary: Ping / Health Diagnostic
    Primary-->>Router: 503 Service Unavailable / HTTP 429 Rate Limit
    Router->>Router: Circuit Breaker TRIPPED for Primary
    Router->>Router: Trigger Failover Heuristic -> Select AWS Bedrock
    Router->>Secondary: Health Diagnostic Check
    Secondary-->>Router: 200 OK (Healthy)
    Router->>Assembler: SubmitRoutePlan(Target = AWS Bedrock)
    Assembler-->>Router: Job Accepted
    Router-->>Client: 200 OK (RoutePlanResult with Failover Flag)